rget, Beta will fire a laser at them, dealing 60 (+50% Total Physical Attack) (+8*Hero Level) True Damage and briefly applying a powerful slow effect.\nThis skill only deals 75% damage to Creeps.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6b3c9aef499eeb19ec98dfbac22bb33c.png","video":null,"cd":null,"cost":null,"is_passive":true,"tags":[{"name":"Damage","rgb":"199,121,85"},{"name":"Slow","rgb":"205,93,109"}]},{"id":2810,"name":"Rotary Impact","description":"Alpha unleashes an energy wave in the target direction, dealing 100 (+90% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in its path and slowing them by 40% for 1s.\n\nBeta then strafes enemies along the same path, dealing 60 (+30% Extra Physical Attack) True Damage.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_8feb5b13b48b71de18f1490269cb1623.png","video":null,"cd":4.0,"cost":50.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"AOE","rgb":"199,121,85"},{"name":"Slow","rgb":"205,93,109"}]},{"id":2820,"name":"Force Swing","description":"After a short delay, Alpha swings his blade in the target direction, dealing 180 (+100% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in a fan-shaped area and recovering 80 (+40% Extra Physical Attack) HP for the first enemy hit (healing decays by 40% for each additional enemy hit).\n\nBeta then strafes enemies in the same area, dealing 60 (+30% Total Physical Attack) True Damage.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_601fedfb2ef64598acdf449ad2b29216.png","video":null,"cd":6.0,"cost":45.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"AOE","rgb":"199,121,85"},{"name":"Heal","rgb":"89,168,111"}]},{"id":2830,"name":"Spear of Alpha","description":"Beta dives to the target location, dealing 100 (+20% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit and stunning them for 1s. Alpha then leaps towards the same location, knocking enemies in his path airborne and carrying them to the landing location. Alpha then slams down, dealing 250 (+100% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage and slowing the enemies by 40% for 1.5s.\n\nBeta then attacks the same area 5 times, dealing 15 (+30% Extra Physical Attack) True Damage each time.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_7f192b19efc5c9dcbd6e5c11e187e86d.png","video":null,"cd":null,"cost":null,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Mobility","rgb":"162,105,198"},{"name":"CC","rgb":"205,93,109"}]}],"counters":{"assist":{"desc":"Alpha works well with heroes that can initiate with CC like Vexana and Selena. With their help, he'll have a much easier time landing his skills.","heroes":[{"id":38,"name":"Vexana","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_743edd1702084c4ed247908d698bca77.png"},{"id":63,"name":"Selena","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c3f967121519ae40509c5b2fdf52b19d.png"}]},"strong":{"desc":"Alpha counters heroes that lack mobility, such as Layla and Ixia, because these heroes have a hard time avoiding his skills.","heroes":[{"id":18,"name":"Layla","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b2b38e9406ea0de0b866db7674feea0f.png"},{"id":121,"name":"Ixia","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f070d82521ecd2e14d4ef3f25880830a.png"}]},"weak":{"desc":"Alpha is countered by heroes that are very mobile, such as Chou and Gusion, because they have a lot of ways to dodge Alpha's skills.","heroes":[{"id":26,"name":"Chou","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_158209b180032c4564b8f3bde8c48888.png"},{"id":56,"name":"Gusion","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c6cd232de60da5372a7101a203e56554.png"}]}},"official_url":"https://play.mobilelegends.com/lore/hero/alph